  "releaseNotes": "___ Changes  ---\n\t\t  Fixed arrays are now pinnable and use ref this[...]\n\t\t  Added FixedPtrArry they are also pinnable, but no ref this[...]\n\t\t  Added function overloads named *_str which accept byte* instead of string\n\t\t  --- Changes  ---\n\t\t  Correct description -> release notes are now in the package release note section\n\t\t  --- Changes ---\n\t\t  Added hwcontext for OpenCL, DirectX12, Vulkan and Cuda\n\t\t  --- BugFix ---\n\t\t  Last version build for FFmpeg 9.0 (pre)",
